    },
    {
        "id": 6,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   No...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "No..."
    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   Impossible! Impossible...!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "Impossible! Impossible...!"
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   H-how could this be?! Skullshatterer, Skullshatterer!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "H-how could this be?! Skullshatterer, Skullshatterer!"
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   W-we can't let Misha see this...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "W-we can't let Misha see this..."
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   Who here knows first aid? Get them over here now!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "Who here knows first aid? Get them over here now!"
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   Damn it, why did Mephisto refuse to come? What is he doing?!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "Damn it, why did Mephisto refuse to come? What is he doing?!"
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   He kept talking about some 'other plan'... What the hell is with that?!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "He kept talking about some 'other plan'... What the hell is with that?!"
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   If he was here, we would've been able to save so many people!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "If he was here, we would've been able to save so many people!"
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": ""
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\", name2=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   We can't count on that guy anyway. He doesn't care about his comrades anyway.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "We can't count on that guy anyway. He doesn't care about his comrades anyway."
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\", name2=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   ...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "..."
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\", name2=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   Don't blame yourself for things you can't control.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "Don't blame yourself for things you can't control."
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\", name2=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   Thanks for covering us, W...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "Thanks for covering us, W..."
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   At least, we were able to bring him back.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "At least, we were able to bring him back."
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\", name2=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   If you want to thank me, do it through your actions.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "If you want to thank me, do it through your actions."
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\", name2=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   Of course. We'll cover your escape... However, I have one request--",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "Of course. We'll cover your escape... However, I have one request--"
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   Please promise to take care of Misha.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "Please promise to take care of Misha."
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\", name2=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   Of course. After all...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "Of course. After all..."
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_012_misa_1#5\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#5"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   I am still of use to you, right?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "I am still of use to you, right?"
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   We...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "We..."
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_012_misa_1\", name2=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   Please let me spend some time with Skullshatterer alone.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "Please let me spend some time with Skullshatterer alone."
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   I will... take care of him.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "I will... take care of him."
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_012_misa_1\", name2=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   But...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "But..."
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   ... ...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "... ..."
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   ...Fine.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "...Fine."
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   W, it's a promise. One that you must keep.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "W, it's a promise. One that you must keep."
    },
