        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   Lungmen and Rhodes Island will come barging in here any moment now.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "Lungmen and Rhodes Island will come barging in here any moment now."
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   I guess the people here are going to die too.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "I guess the people here are going to die too."
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   My, oh my, what a dilemma we have.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "My, oh my, what a dilemma we have."
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   Misha, so many more people are going to die because of you...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "Misha, so many more people are going to die because of you..."
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   What a pity.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "What a pity."
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_012_misa_1\", name2=\"char_1504_cqbw\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   You're really getting on my nerves, W.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "You're really getting on my nerves, W."
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   You won't get anything from me.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "You won't get anything from me."
    },
    {
        "id": 65,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_012_misa_1\", name2=\"char_1504_cqbw\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   Wooahh, scary~",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "Wooahh, scary~"
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   You know, that bunny girl seems to really care about you~",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "You know, that bunny girl seems to really care about you~"
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   But, that Ch'en lady seems different.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "But, that Ch'en lady seems different."
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   She won't show mercy to anyone.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "She won't show mercy to anyone."
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   Maybe she'll decide to spare your life, because she needs you...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "Maybe she'll decide to spare your life, because she needs you..."
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   But you've seen enough in Ursus to know what will happen after that, right?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "But you've seen enough in Ursus to know what will happen after that, right?"
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_012_misa_1\", name2=\"char_1504_cqbw\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 73,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   ...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "..."
    },
    {
        "id": 74,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_012_misa_1\", name2=\"char_1504_cqbw\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 75,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   If you come with me now, it's still not too late.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "If you come with me now, it's still not too late."
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   Although... you'd still have to watch all our Reunion friends sacrifice themselves...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "Although... you'd still have to watch all our Reunion friends sacrifice themselves..."
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   I suppose that's just their fate though.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "I suppose that's just their fate though."
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]   Such pitiful things.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "Such pitiful things."
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_012_misa_1\", name2=\"char_1504_cqbw\", focus=1)]",
